udgment and [ФАКТ] where it's about what §4.8 says or what the codebase shows.\n\nLet me write concisely but completely. This is a substantive pedagogical answer so moderate length is justified, but I should stay tight.\n\nI should probably end with a clarifying question: what are \"пункты 3 и 4 из сообщения 9\" so I know what \"довести фиксацию до конца\" refers to, since builtin-baseline already looks pinned+checked. And ask whether she wants me to now turn this into a plan.\n\nLet me write the answer.",
