только одно\" is dangling.\n\nActually, \"потому каскада падений не будет. только одно\" — likely means \"только одно [падение, а не каскад]\". It's a slightly awkward fragment but understandable. Minor, can note.\n\nLet me also reconsider: the changelog header/preable is good. The date is 2026-10-01 which matches today.\n\nLet me finalize. I'll present:\n1. Two substantive errors (t4 typo, угол/вершина).\n2. Typos batch.\n3. Minor/optional.\n4. Note on completeness (nothing major missing — good).\n5. Self-check.\n\nI'll be concise but complete. Since she asked specifically \"проверь на неполноту и или ошибки\", I'll focus on errors + note completeness.\n\nLet me write it.\n\nActually, I should double check one thing about the \"угол\" claim — is polygon_vertex perhaps returning something angle-related? No, from geometry.h: `COMMON_API struct Point polygon_vertex(int i, int n);` and the header comment (garbled but I can infer) is \"для вычисления вершины правильного N-угольника\". Returns struct Point. So it's a vertex (point), definitely not an angle. Confident.\n\nLet me write the final review.",
